FastAPI backend for the recorder. Same 3 operations as before, now as a
proper JSON API consumed by the Next.js frontend (frontend/) or anything
else you want to point at it (curl, Postman, another UI) - plus auth
(backend/auth_routes.py), admin (backend/admin_routes.py) and profile
(backend/profile_routes.py) routers mounted below. Every /api/* route in
this file now requires a logged-in user (Depends(get_current_user)); admin
endpoints live in their own router.

Run with:
    uvicorn backend.api:app --reload --port 8000
"""
